window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Enid (Book 3) – A Fantasy Romance Thriller. </p> <p>In the epic conclusion of the Enid trilogy, Enid stands at the crossroads of fate, her heart and soul caught between the chaos of war and the intensity of love. With danger closing in, she must confront her deepest fears and desires while navigating the treacherous battlefield—both in the realm and within herself. As dark forces rise in both Deep Haven and the Land of Fairies, alliances are tested, and battles rage on, Enid's strength is pushed to its limits. The choices that she makes will determine not only her own destiny but the fate of those who she loves. Will she emerge victorious, or will the cost be too high? </p> <p>With breathtaking action, gripping suspense, and a love story that burns through the darkness, Enid (Book 3) delivers a thrilling and emotional finale where passion meets peril—and only the bravest hearts will survive.</p>"; 
